{"product_id":"five-point-someone-what-not-to-do-at-iit","title":"Five Point Someone","description":"\u003cp\u003eSet in IIT, in the early '90s, Five Point Someone portrays the lives of the protagonist Hari and his two friends Ryan and Alok. It explores the darker side of IIT, one in which students- having worked for years to make it into the institute-struggle to maintain their grades, keep their friends and have some kind of life outside studies. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:137 x 208  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Chetan Bhagat \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9788129104595 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 275\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41753313378457,"sku":"13RC9788129104595","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/9aa8fdb9e1655476b230e270d88b3f15_709a4752-76fd-4bf1-9fde-b451b3e85e0d.jpg?v=1698049701","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/five-point-someone-what-not-to-do-at-iit","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}